nd the wall  aka beyond a designated LD in territory  when they were kids as a result his  sister was taken by a soldier and ripped  apart by dogs for his amusement Grisha  would probably have also been killed in  a gruesome manner if the LD in spy known  as the owl had  rescues him after this event Grizzard  developed a deep-seated hatred for the  Marlon government and eventually joined  the LDN restorationist a group of LD  ants who sought to overthrow the Marlon  government and restore LD and power  Risha eventually married Deena a member  of the royal LD n family that did not  follow the first king Fritz to the  island of paradise where he used the  founding Tyson power also known as the  coordinate to build the three walls and  erase the memory of the LD n people so  that they would forget about Marley and  come to believe that they were the last  remnants of humanity in a world overrun  by Titans the LD n restoration has  viewed the king as a traitor because he  abandoned the conflict with Marley and  as a result left the rest of the LD ins  to suffer under the oppression of the  Marlon people the restorationist knew  that in order to restore LD n power they  would need to acquire this power the  power of the founding Titan by the way  if you want to know more about the  coordinate and the founding Titan power  check out the coordinate explained video  which I'll leave in the description  eventually Grisha and Deena had a kid  and named him Zeke some years later the  Marlon government was looking for LD and  kids because they needed them to use the  seven Titan powers they had stolen from  the LD n people remember only Ella  beings could become Titans or Titan  shifters without LD n warriors the  Marlon government could not harness any  of the nine Titan powers Grisha then got  an idea he would hand Zeke his son over  to the Marlon government and make him an  LD n mole however to his surprise  Zeke betrayed him the young Zeke was  brainwashed by the Malayan government  and ratted out his parents who were then  arrested and taken to the island of  paradise where they were both supposed  to be turned into mindless Titans  although Grisha obviously escaped that  fate  thanks to Aaron Kruger the owl what is  unclear though is whether or not Grisha  and Deena told Zeke about his royal  blood in the manga it is clear that the  Marlon government had no idea that Deena  or Zeke were members of the royal LD n  family but the real question is does eek  know and is he keeping this secret that  information may come into play later in  the manga so Zeke became the perfect  Marlon warrior he eventually acquired  the beast Titan power and made his way  through the ranks  until he eventually earned the title of  war tree the highest and most honored  position any LDN can hope to get in the  Marlin nation another thing that other  characters find surprising is  high-ranking male officials seem to take  zieks advice and thoughts seriously when  thinking about what to do next  both Reiner and Bertolt reported to him  and together they all went to the island  of paradise to take the coordinate power  for the merlion government it is clear  that Bertolt and Reiner look up to him  because Amir notices that they look at  the beast Titan like excited children  when they spot him at boot guard castle  on the island of paradise where the main  attack on Titan story takes place the  beast Titan as we know caused many  problems for the survey Corps he defeats  one of the strongest and most eccentric  soldiers in the survey Corps BK  effortlessly really he turns the people  of Connie's village into Titans and  commands Titans to attack the survey  corps at would guard castle he also  plans the final assault on the survey  corps at the Battle of shegaon Shiina  district he almost defeats the survey  corps but while he is throwing chunks of  stones at groups of soldiers that are  charging at him and shooting smoke  flares he is caught off guard by Levi  and almost killed  however peak a fellow Titan shifter and  Marlin warrior saves him in the nick of  time in her Titan form which is called  Cartman Zeke stops to tell heir and his  half-brother that they were both victims  of grisha's brainwashing and that he  will come back to save him before  escaping back to marlane afterwards the  male Mideast war begins  Zeke fights with the other Titan  shifters working for the Marlin  government but is almost killed again  this time by anti Titan artillery  however Reiner using his power of the  armored Titan shields him from the blast  Zeke was a formidable and frightening  opponent now recognises that  technological advancements are beginning  to eclipse even his power he also  revealed in the newer chapters of the  manga that he is actually scared of the  Ackerman clan and hopes that he never  has to fight Levi again it's interesting  seeing him arguably the most powerful  Titan shifter scared for once by the  power of one of our main characters when  this whole time  it was the Titans and especially the  Beast sight and were portrayed as the  scary ones nevertheless Zeke wants to go  back to parodies and capture to  coordinate as soon as possible because  his time is running out as mentioned due  to Amir's curse he only has one year  left before he has to pass on his powers  to warrior cadet Colt Grice and the next  possessor is unlikely to be as powerful  as eek it is acknowledged that Zeke has  powers that previous possessors didn't  and people are curious as to why that is  but the audience knows that is probably  related to the fact that he has royal  blood also the new chapter chapter 94  recently came out and I did a review for  it linked in the description in this  manga chapter we see that Zeke is still  close to his Marlin fearing grandparents  Krishna's parents and visits them at the  internment Zone the Vario when he gets  the chance that's all we know about Zeke  so far although I can't wait to see what  happens with him next now let's get into  the beast I need special abilities it is  important to note that some of these  special abilities are specific to Zeke  and have not been possessed by previous  beast titans such as his ability to  change humans into titans it is  important to mention Zeke's excellent  control of his Titan form he always  retains his human mind in Titan form  unlike Aaron and he can even speak  fluently and for extended periods of  time in his Titan form that is not  possible for any other Titan shifters  except peek in her Titan form and Amir  and even a mere a very skilled Titan  shifter and an exception to the rule can  only utter a word or two at a time  Zeke speaks to humans but also gives  orders to other Titans which they  usually follow if they were created by  his own spinal fluid although as the  incident with me K and the Titan that  was holding him revealed the control  isn't perfect like the founding Titans  control would be in theory like all  titans Zeke has superhuman regeneration  after Levi nearly kills him Sheik is  shown talking to Aaron and his face is  already partially healed like a knee  Zeke is also able to harden his Titan  body and he tries to harden the nape of  his neck when Levi attacks him but the  ability needs time to work and Levi  proves to be too fast for him also like  rider has shown it appears that other  Titans can transfer their brain activity  to the rest of their nervous system  while also using the Titans brain in  order  to survive having their head cut off he  also possesses immense strength and is  able to break off chunks of the wall and  hurl them accurately from extremely far  distances he seems to be a fan of  baseball since he refers to his Boulder  tosses as pitches and says he's hoping  for a perfect game in the Battle of  shegaon Shiina he also seems to be a  formidable fighter since he was able to  defeat the armored Titan without showing  any visible sign of injury or fatigue  himself lastly his most impressive  ability is his ability to transform  humans into titans that will obey his  commands Zeke possesses a scream that he  can use while a human form to transform  humans that have been injected with his  spinal fluid in two titans unlike  regular titans these Titans have been  able to move at night but hanji  speculates that they can only move under  a full moon  and speaking of hungry you guys might  find it interesting to know that Zeke  and hungie were tied for smartest  character in the official attack on  titan guidebook both scoring 11 out of  10 this says a lot about the current  beast times mental prowess but this is  yet another trait which cannot be passed  down so that is what we know so far  about Zeke and about the beast titans  unique abilities however for me Zeke is  still a bit of an enigma what does he  mean when he says he will rescue Aaron  is he really the obedient unquestioning  marilaine warrior that he appears to be  or is this hairy genius hiding something  Zeke's name is a shortened form for  Ezekiel which is Hebrew for God will  strengthen in the Bible Ezekiel was a  prophet among the Hebrews exiled to  Babylon who prophesized destruction of  Jerusalem and Israel's restoration could  this be a complete coincidence or will  Zeke actually have a part to play in LDS  restoration hmm  I personally wouldn't be surprised if  there is more to Zeke than it seems at  the moment let me know what you guys  think about Zeke in the comment section  below I would love to hear your thoughts  what is he planning anyways guys if you  made it all the way to the end you rock  thank you so much for watching if you  enjoyed this video be sure to go beast  mode on that like button and subscribe  for more attack on Titan videos you can  also check out our attack on Titan  playlist on the left of your screen if  you want to see more videos like this  consider supporting us on patreon link  in the description  until next time see you space co